1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:02,840
Building rag used to be artisanal,

2
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:05,840
and not in a nice sourdough kind of way, before you

3
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:09,840
could build the application, you had to build the workshop itself,

4
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:12,840
choose an index type, tune back to settings, wire

5
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:16,840
up models, decide how to chunk the data, and configure everything in between.

6
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:20,840
Now, that's fine, and it can even be fun, but if

7
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:22,840
your goal is to ship something to an end user.

8
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:24,840
That's a lot of work before the real work begins.

9
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:29,840
So, elastic is introducing a dedicated vector

10
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:31,840
database project type, one serverless.

11
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:34,840
Think of it like a modern, fully featured workshop

12
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:36,840
for rag and agent retrieval.

13
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,840
It uses the recently added vector DB index mode with

14
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:42,840
vector oriented defaults.

15
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:45,840
You get vector and semantic search for similarity,

16
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:49,840
BM25 for precision, and filters to rule things in or out.

17
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:53,840
Then, a preconfigured Gina reranker can

18
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:54,840
put the best candidate first.

19
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:59,840
This project comes preconfigured with sensible defaults,

20
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:02,840
like the efficient disk BBQ index and class leading

21
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:04,840
multilingual Gena models.

22
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:07,840
So instead of sizing a cluster or tuning back to settings,

23
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:11,840
you can start solving real problems, getting feedback,

24
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:12,840
iterating, and scaling.

25
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:15,840
We're really excited to see you build with it.

26
00:01:16,840 --> 00:01:19,840
The Back to DV Project type is now available on server list.

27
00:01:19,840 --> 00:01:21,840
So try it out and let us know what you think below.